  "instructions": {
    "zh": "选择一段你愿意回顾的成年亲密关系，围绕同一段关系考虑近三个月通常出现的情境。按出现频率选择1从不到5几乎总是；没有适用经历、无法判断或不愿回答请选择不计分项。无需填写对方名字或私人文字，也不要替对方作答。",
    "en": "Choose one adult close relationship you are willing to reflect on, and consider typical situations in that same relationship over the past three months. Rate frequency from 1, never, to 5, almost always. Use the unscored option when no experience applies, you are unsure or you prefer not to answer. No name or private text is needed; do not answer for the other person."
  },
